{
  "name": "claudeconnect",
  "version": "2.5.2",
  "released": "2026-10-14",
  "notes": [
    "Signing in during setup no longer crashes. The claude.ai sign-in now runs in your terminal, the same as the Cloudflare one, so opening a browser to sign in works (it was failing with an \"EINVAL kqueue\" error on Macs).",
    "The setup window opens as its own plain window, without browser tabs or an address bar, when you have a Chromium-based browser (Chrome, Edge, Brave). It's thrown away when it closes and installs nothing. Without one of those browsers it opens in your normal browser as before."
